<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian cement firm Jbel Oust '96 profit down.</title>
<headline>Tunisian cement firm Jbel Oust '96 profit down.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisian cement factory Ciments de Jbel Oust net profits for 1996 were 11.50 million dinars, down from 31.27 million dinars in 1995, results showed on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Net operating profit was 5.30 million dinars compared to 27.08 million dinars.</p>
<p>The state-controlled firm is among the country's cement factories forecast to be privatised at a date not yet set.</p>
</text>
